stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Clean: Load accepted revision
    Clean --> Dirty: Eligible local change
    Dirty --> Dirty: More local changes
    Dirty --> Uploading: Debounce elapsed and service available
    Uploading --> Clean: Accepted revision and no later local edits
    Uploading --> Dirty: Accepted revision but later edits remain
    Uploading --> RetryPending: Connection failure
    RetryPending --> Uploading: Retry same pending operation safely
    Uploading --> Conflict: Server revision is newer
    Conflict --> Reloading: Explain conflict and apply required server reload policy
    Reloading --> Clean: Newer authoritative snapshot loaded
    Reloading --> Conflict: Download fails / preserve unresolved state
